[
{
"i": 0,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "In my town, when someone is about to disappear, their shoes walk home first.",
"s": 0.0,
"e": 3.28
},
{
"i": 1,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "It always starts at sunset.",
"s": 3.427,
"e": 4.813
},
{
"i": 2,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "A pair of shoes comes walking up the street.",
"s": 4.96,
"e": 6.56
},
{
"i": 3,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "Nobody inside them.",
"s": 6.707,
"e": 7.507
},
{
"i": 4,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "Step. Step. Step.",
"s": 7.653,
"e": 9.147
},
{
"i": 5,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "They climb onto a porch and stop.",
"s": 9.293,
"e": 10.733
},
{
"i": 6,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "That's your house.",
"s": 10.88,
"e": 11.627
},
{
"i": 7,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "At midnight, the owner is gone.",
"s": 11.773,
"e": 13.267
},
{
"i": 8,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "All that's left are bare footprints in the snow, walking into the woods.",
"s": 13.413,
"e": 16.24
},
{
"i": 9,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "So we have rules.",
"s": 16.387,
"e": 17.347
},
{
"i": 10,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "Never touch the shoes.",
"s": 17.493,
"e": 18.507
},
{
"i": 11,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "Leave them on the porch.",
"s": 18.653,
"e": 19.453
},
{
"i": 12,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "Lock the door.",
"s": 19.6,
"e": 20.24
},
{
"i": 13,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "Pray.",
"s": 20.387,
"e": 20.813
},
{
"i": 14,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "The chapel board counts us every morning.",
"s": 20.96,
"e": 22.453
},
{
"i": 15,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "140.",
"s": 22.6,
"e": 23.347
},
{
"i": 16,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "I'm Leo.",
"s": 23.493,
"e": 23.973
},
{
"i": 17,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "My little brother Max is eight, and he wears my old sneakers.",
"s": 24.12,
"e": 26.253
},
{
"i": 18,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "Two sizes too big.",
"s": 26.4,
"e": 27.36
},
{
"i": 19,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "When I gave them to him, I said, \"What's mine is yours.\"",
"s": 27.507,
"e": 29.747
},
{
"i": 20,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "He never stopped saying it back.",
"s": 29.893,
"e": 31.173
},
{
"i": 21,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "Grandma watched him lace them up and said,",
"s": 31.32,
"e": 32.707
},
{
"i": 22,
"speaker": "GRAN",
"text": "\"Shoes don't care whose feet they're on.\"",
"s": 32.773,
"e": 34.203
},
{
"i": 23,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "We laughed.",
"s": 34.349,
"e": 34.883
},
{
"i": 24,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "We thought she meant hand-me-downs.",
"s": 35.029,
"e": 36.096
},
{
"i": 25,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "The first night, Mrs Ruiz's slippers came home.",
"s": 36.243,
"e": 38.216
},
{
"i": 26,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "She put them on to see if they still fit.",
"s": 38.363,
"e": 39.696
},
{
"i": 27,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "At midnight, she was gone.",
"s": 39.843,
"e": 41.176
},
{
"i": 28,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "Bare footprints, right into the trees.",
"s": 41.323,
"e": 42.923
},
{
"i": 29,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "121.",
"s": 43.069,
"e": 43.763
},
{
"i": 30,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "Then old Mr Hale's boots came home.",
"s": 43.909,
"e": 45.616
},
{
"i": 31,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "He lived alone.",
"s": 45.763,
"e": 46.349
},
{
"i": 32,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "He laughed, pulled them on and went out to shovel his porch.",
"s": 46.496,
"e": 48.736
},
{
"i": 33,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "Midnight.",
"s": 48.883,
"e": 49.309
},
{
"i": 34,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "Just a shovel, standing in the snow.",
"s": 49.456,
"e": 50.949
},
{
"i": 35,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "97.",
"s": 51.096,
"e": 51.683
},
{
"i": 36,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "Then baby Lily's tiny shoes came home.",
"s": 51.829,
"e": 53.643
},
{
"i": 37,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "Her mom grabbed them and hid them in the closet, so Lily would never see them.",
"s": 53.789,
"e": 56.456
},
{
"i": 38,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "At midnight, her mom was gone.",
"s": 56.603,
"e": 58.096
},
{
"i": 39,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "But Lily was still asleep in her crib.",
"s": 58.243,
"e": 59.683
},
{
"i": 40,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "Strangely, the footprints outside were big.",
"s": 59.829,
"e": 61.749
},
{
"i": 41,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "Grown-up big.",
"s": 61.896,
"e": 62.589
},
{
"i": 42,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "The whole town said her mom went looking for her.",
"s": 62.736,
"e": 64.389
},
{
"i": 43,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "Mr Ortiz sold hot cocoa to everyone watching the woods.",
"s": 64.536,
"e": 66.909
},
{
"i": 44,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "Two dollars.",
"s": 67.056,
"e": 67.589
},
{
"i": 45,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "80.",
"s": 67.736,
"e": 68.056
},
{
"i": 46,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "Then, at 9:00, I heard it.",
"s": 68.203,
"e": 69.803
},
{
"i": 47,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "Step. Step. Step.",
"s": 69.949,
"e": 71.389
},
{
"i": 48,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "Max's sneakers walked up our porch steps.",
"s": 71.536,
"e": 73.296
},
{
"i": 49,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "Max screamed.",
"s": 73.443,
"e": 74.136
},
{
"i": 50,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "Mom grabbed him.",
"s": 74.283,
"e": 74.923
},
{
"i": 51,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "I couldn't let him touch them.",
"s": 75.069,
"e": 75.923
},
{
"i": 52,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "So I picked them up myself, ran them out to the woods and threw them as hard as I could.",
"s": 76.069,
"e": 79.056
},
{
"i": 53,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "10:00.",
"s": 79.203,
"e": 79.736
},
{
"i": 54,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "They were back on the porch.",
"s": 79.883,
"e": 80.843
},
{
"i": 55,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "11:00.",
"s": 80.989,
"e": 81.629
},
{
"i": 56,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "Max was shaking under his blanket.",
"s": 81.776,
"e": 83.056
},
{
"i": 57,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "11:30.",
"s": 83.203,
"e": 83.843
},
{
"i": 58,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "I shoved them inside my own boots, under my bed, and sat on top of it all.",
"s": 83.989,
"e": 86.736
},
{
"i": 59,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "That's when I noticed my socks.",
"s": 86.883,
"e": 88.003
},
{
"i": 60,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "They were wet.",
"s": 88.149,
"e": 88.683
},
{
"i": 61,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "Wet with snow I never walked in.",
"s": 88.829,
"e": 90.376
},
{
"i": 62,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "11:58.",
"s": 90.523,
"e": 91.323
},
{
"i": 63,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "11:59.",
"s": 91.469,
"e": 92.323
},
{
"i": 64,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "12:00.",
"s": 92.469,
"e": 93.003
},
{
"i": 65,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "I ran to Max's room.",
"s": 93.149,
"e": 94.109
},
{
"i": 66,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "He was still there.",
"s": 94.256,
"e": 94.949
},
{
"i": 67,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "Snoring.",
"s": 95.096,
"e": 95.523
},
{
"i": 68,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "He was safe.",
"s": 95.669,
"e": 96.256
},
{
"i": 69,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "I hugged him and laughed so hard I cried.",
"s": 96.403,
"e": 98.323
},
{
"i": 70,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "Then my feet started walking.",
"s": 98.469,
"e": 99.856
},
{
"i": 71,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "I didn't tell them to.",
"s": 100.003,
"e": 100.803
},
{
"i": 72,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "Down the stairs.",
"s": 100.949,
"e": 101.589
},
{
"i": 73,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "Out the door.",
"s": 101.736,
"e": 102.216
},
{
"i": 74,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "Barefoot in the snow.",
"s": 102.363,
"e": 103.163
},
{
"i": 75,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "Mrs Ruiz touched her slippers.",
"s": 103.309,
"e": 104.643
},
{
"i": 76,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "Mr Hale touched his boots.",
"s": 104.789,
"e": 105.936
},
{
"i": 77,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "Lily's mom touched Lily's shoes.",
"s": 106.083,
"e": 107.523
},
{
"i": 78,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "Lily never did.",
"s": 107.669,
"e": 108.416
},
{
"i": 79,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "And neither did Max.",
"s": 108.563,
"e": 109.389
},
{
"i": 80,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "Shoes don't care whose feet they're on.",
"s": 109.536,
"e": 110.949
},
{
"i": 81,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "I grabbed the doorframe.",
"s": 111.096,
"e": 112.056
},
{
"i": 82,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "My fingers slipped.",
"s": 112.203,
"e": 113.003
},
{
"i": 83,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "One. By. One.",
"s": 113.149,
"e": 114.696
},
{
"i": 84,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "Max ran to the door.",
"s": 114.843,
"e": 115.696
},
{
"i": 85,
"speaker": "MAX",
"text": "\"Where are you going?\"",
"s": 115.843,
"e": 116.418
},
{
"i": 86,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "\"What's mine is yours,\" I whispered.",
"s": 116.565,
"e": 118.073
},
{
"i": 87,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "The next night, a pair of boots walked up our porch.",
"s": 118.219,
"e": 120.406
},
{
"i": 88,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "My boots.",
"s": 120.553,
"e": 121.086
},
{
"i": 89,
"speaker": "N",
"text": "And Max reached for them.",
"s": 121.233,
"e": 122.104
}
]